"notes": "Modified cash basis; GAAP-like net position statement with no liabilities. Top-level receipts/disbursements from Total Governmental Funds column (p4); fund columns include General fund plus Depreciation and Employee Benefit funds in the General column (all governmental, school nutrition included, no business-type funds). Beginning/ending cash are fund balances 5,308,693 to 7,339,600 (cash on hand + county treasurer). FIX PASS (attempt 2): the 490,000 Transfers from General (p9) was moved out of Other local receipts (880,884 -> 390,884, split_from) into transfers_in; printed total receipts 17,505,154 includes it (includes: transfers_in). No page shows where the 490,000 leaves the General Fund (no elimination column; p5 General disbursements 14,095,479 = p8 14,215,479 less the 120,000 transfer; p4 General transfers (120,000) only), so disbursements are kept as printed and the one-sided transfer is recorded in report_discrepancies. Other transfers (General -120,000, Activity +20,000, Nutrition +100,000) net to zero in the total column and are not recorded at top level. Activity fund receipts 278,521 on p4 exclude the 20,000 transfer. Statement p4 labels Support services - students/instruction appear swapped vs the p7 General Fund schedule (guidance/health totals 756,784 are 'Student'; 272,366 are 'Instruction'); statement lines kept as printed. Detail: General Fund schedule (p6-8) records the General Fund proper (excludes Depreciation/Employee Benefit funds); its printed Grand Total of All Receipts 15,632,880 includes non-revenue 2,332; its Total Disbursements 14,215,479 includes the 120,000 transfer out (recorded as other financing -120,000). On p7 the heading over 2120-2181 is printed 'Support Services - Staff' but its subtotal reads 'Total Support Services - Student'; department recorded as Support Services - Student. Budget amounts for General Fund are printed only as grand totals (14,357,759 receipts; 14,606,106 disbursements), so budget_final is null per line. Combining schedule on p5 not itemized (fund totals only, duplicates p4). Employee Benefit, Bond, Special Building, Student Fee, QCPUF, Contingency, Nutrition fund schedules not in trimmed PDF (original p27 missing). Detail category for expenditures all 'not itemized' since schedule is by function only. Read pages 1-10 of 10"
